1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,043
This is the Shah Investor's Home I P O, a mainboard offer,

2
00:00:04,043 --> 00:00:08,085
open from the twenty-eighth to the thirtieth of September.

3
00:00:08,585 --> 00:00:11,648
The price band is ₹159 to ₹167.

4
00:00:11,648 --> 00:00:17,674
Every figure here comes from the final red herring prospectus

5
00:00:17,674 --> 00:00:19,749
and exchange notices;

6
00:00:19,749 --> 00:00:23,601
the final price is fixed after bidding,

7
00:00:23,601 --> 00:00:27,849
so valuations are computed at the ₹167 cap.

8
00:00:28,349 --> 00:00:29,587
First, the business.

9
00:00:30,087 --> 00:00:34,378
Shah Investor's Home is a stock broker with a sizeable client

10
00:00:34,378 --> 00:00:35,785
base across Gujarat,

11
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:38,599
using online platforms to serve clients.

12
00:00:39,099 --> 00:00:46,478
Broking income moves with market activity, and FY26 was weaker:

13
00:00:46,478 --> 00:00:51,515
revenue fell 24.18% and profit fell 44.03%.

14
00:00:52,015 --> 00:00:53,615
The financial checkpoint.

15
00:00:54,115 --> 00:01:04,623
FY26 revenue was ₹71.48 Cr, against ₹94.27 Cr in FY25,

16
00:01:04,623 --> 00:01:08,515
a change of -24.18%.

17
00:01:09,015 --> 00:01:16,247
Profit after tax was ₹13.11 Cr, a margin of 18.34%.

18
00:01:16,747 --> 00:01:18,176
Both lines went down.

19
00:01:18,676 --> 00:01:24,398
Profit fell to ₹13.11 Cr from ₹23.42 Cr,

20
00:01:24,398 --> 00:01:29,833
and the return on net worth was 7.35%.

21
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:34,657
The offer size at the cap is ₹90.17 Cr,

22
00:01:34,657 --> 00:01:37,651
and it is 100% fresh issue.

23
00:01:38,151 --> 00:01:40,536
All of that money goes into the company;

24
00:01:40,536 --> 00:01:43,399
no existing shareholder is selling in this deal.

25
00:01:43,899 --> 00:01:45,221
Where does the money go?

26
00:01:45,721 --> 00:01:51,975
It is a 100% fresh issue of 53,99,200 shares,

27
00:01:51,975 --> 00:01:55,727
about ₹90.17 Cr at the cap.

28
00:01:56,227 --> 00:01:58,558
₹60.00 Cr funds working capital,

29
00:01:58,558 --> 00:02:02,200
and the balance is for general corporate purposes.

30
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,748
No existing shareholder is selling.

31
00:02:05,248 --> 00:02:06,251
Valuation.

32
00:02:06,751 --> 00:02:09,278
At the ₹167 cap,

33
00:02:09,278 --> 00:02:17,332
the price is 19.93x FY26 earnings of ₹8.38 a share.

34
00:02:17,832 --> 00:02:26,225
Broking peers range from Share India at 11.70x and S M C Global

35
00:02:26,225 --> 00:02:31,421
at 16.28x to Arihant Capital at 27.09x.

36
00:02:31,921 --> 00:02:33,591
That is mid-range,

37
00:02:33,591 --> 00:02:38,321
but it is priced on a year when profit fell 44.03%.

38
00:02:38,821 --> 00:02:40,315
Now balance the evidence.

39
00:02:40,815 --> 00:02:42,293
Watch-out:

40
00:02:42,293 --> 00:02:45,396
FY26 PAT fell 44.03%.

41
00:02:45,396 --> 00:02:46,726
Strength:

42
00:02:46,726 --> 00:02:51,012
100% fresh, no promoter exit.

43
00:02:51,512 --> 00:02:52,555
Watch-out:

44
00:02:52,555 --> 00:02:55,684
Low 7.35% return on net worth.

45
00:02:55,684 --> 00:02:56,623
Strength:

46
00:02:56,623 --> 00:02:59,960
Established Gujarat client base.

47
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:01,564
Watch-out:

48
00:03:01,564 --> 00:03:04,985
Income tied to market activity.

49
00:03:04,985 --> 00:03:05,978
Strength:

50
00:03:05,978 --> 00:03:09,399
19.93x P/E, mid-range of peers.

51
00:03:09,899 --> 00:03:11,029
How to apply.

52
00:03:11,529 --> 00:03:15,984
The minimum bid is one lot of 85 shares,

53
00:03:15,984 --> 00:03:19,103
which is ₹14,195 at the cap.

54
00:03:19,603 --> 00:03:23,078
Retail investors can bid up to two lakh rupees,

55
00:03:23,078 --> 00:03:27,219
and allotment is by lottery if retail is oversubscribed.

56
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:32,262
Check live subscription on the N S E or B S E website,

57
00:03:32,262 --> 00:03:33,692
not social media.

58
00:03:34,192 --> 00:03:35,152
Let's recap.

59
00:03:35,652 --> 00:03:41,693
FY26 revenue ₹71.48 Cr, profit ₹13.11 Cr.

60
00:03:41,693 --> 00:03:45,229
The offer is 100% fresh.

61
00:03:45,229 --> 00:03:51,123
Valuation is 19.93x earnings at the cap.

62
00:03:51,123 --> 00:03:56,132
The minimum investment is ₹14,195.

63
00:03:56,632 --> 00:04:00,806
This video is public-source education from the red herring

64
00:04:00,806 --> 00:04:03,108
prospectus and exchange notices.

65
00:04:03,108 --> 00:04:07,066
It is not investment advice and not a buy or sell call.

66
00:04:07,066 --> 00:04:08,865
Read the final documents,

67
00:04:08,865 --> 00:04:11,744
check live subscription on the exchange,

68
00:04:11,744 --> 00:04:14,478
and consult a SEBI-registered adviser.

69
00:04:14,478 --> 00:04:15,917
Thanks for watching.

